  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Rene_Bond">
    <rdfs:label>Rene Bond</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:film rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Fantasm"/>
    <ns1:film rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/The_Jekyll_and_Hyde_Portfolio"/>
    <ns1:film rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Please_Don't_Eat_My_Mother"/>
    <ns1:film rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Necromania"/>
    <ns1:abstract>Rene Bond (October 11, 1950 – June 2, 1996) was an American film actress and stage performer. Bond began her acting career in softcore exploitation films produced by in the late 1960s before moving on to hardcore films in the early 1970s. She was active in the 1970s Los Angeles pornography scene, appearing in more than 80 films and loops. She was noted for her petite figure and conveyed innocence or naivete in her acting approach.</ns1:abstract>
    <ns2:rating>None</ns2:rating>
  </rdf:Description>
