  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Meu_Pedacinho_de_Chão">
    <ns1:abstract>Meu Pedacinho de Chão (English: My Little Piece of Ground) is a Brazilian telenovela written by Benedito Ruy Barbosa and directed by Luiz Fernando Carvalho produced and broadcast by Rede Globo. It aired from April 7 to August 1, 2014. Based on the 1971 telenovela of the same name created by Benedito Ruy Barbosa. It starred Bruna Linzmeyer, Irandhir Santos, Johnny Massaro, Bruno Fagundes, Rodrigo Lombardi, Juliana Paes, Osmar Prado, Antônio Fagundes, Geytsa Garcia and Tomás Sampaio.</ns1:abstract>
    <ns1:runtime rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">2580.0</ns1:runtime>
