  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kung_Mawawala_Ka">
    <ns1:director rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Joel_Lamangan"/>
    <ns1:director rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Soxie_Topacio"/>
    <rdfs:label>Kung Mawawala Ka</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:abstract>Kung Mawawala Ka (International title: A World Without You / transl. If You Will Be Gone) is a Philippine television drama romance series broadcast by GMA Network. Directed by Joel Lamangan, Soxie Topacio and Argel Joseph, it stars Sunshine Dizon and Cogie Domingo. It premiered on April 8, 2002 on the network's Telebabad line up. The series concluded on June 6, 2003 with a total of 298 episodes. It was replaced by Narito ang Puso Ko in its timeslot.</ns1:abstract>
    <ns1:rating>N/A</ns1:rating>
    <ns1:genre>http://dbpedia.org/resource/Drama_(film_and_television)</ns1:genre>
