    <ns1:abstract>Ancient Rome: The Rise and Fall of an Empire is a 2006 BBC One docudrama series, with each episode looking at a different key turning point in the history of the Roman Empire. This docudrama focuses on the Latin western half of the Roman Empire.</ns1:abstract>
