  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Goliath_Awaits">
    <ns1:director rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kevin_Connor_(director)"/>
    <ns1:abstract>Goliath Awaits is a 1981 American made-for-television action adventure science fiction thriller film originally broadcast in two parts in November 1981 on various stations as a part of Operation Prime Time's syndicated programming. It is about an ocean liner sunk by a German U-boat in 1939 whose wreck is discovered in 1981, with over 300 survivors and their descendants living in an air bubble inside the ship.</ns1:abstract>
