    <ns1:starring rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Rei_Haneo"/>
    <ns1:starring rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Takanori_Kikuchi"/>
    <ns1:starring rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Touko_Fujita"/>
    <ns1:director rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ryuta_Tasaki"/>
    <ns1:director rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Osamu_Kaneda"/>
    <ns1:abstract>Kamen Rider Agito (仮面ライダーアギト, Kamen Raidā Agito, Masked Rider ΑGITΩ), is the eleventh installment in the popular Kamen Rider tokusatsu franchise. The series represented the 30th anniversary of the Kamen Rider Series. The series was also a joint collaboration between Ishimori Productions and Toei and was shown on TV Asahi from January 28, 2001 to January 27, 2002. The series served as an indirect sequel to Kamen Rider Kuuga, which this show is set in the same universe as the previous show, and the first Kamen Rider series to not have an ending sequence. The series aired along with Hyakujuu Sentai Gaoranger. The series is airing on Toku since November 2020.</ns1:abstract>
    <ns1:genre>http://dbpedia.org/resource/Superhero_fiction</ns1:genre>
    <ns1:genre>http://dbpedia.org/resource/Science_fiction</ns1:genre>
    <ns1:genre>http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tokusatsu</ns1:genre>
    <ns1:releaseDate>2001-01-28</ns1:releaseDate>
    <rdfs:label>Kamen Rider Agito</rdfs:label>
