  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Nuclear_Secrets">
    <ns1:abstract>Nuclear Secrets, aka Spies, Lies and the Superbomb, is a 2007 BBC Television docudrama series which looks at the race for nuclear supremacy from the Manhattan Project through to Pakistan's nuclear weapons programme.</ns1:abstract>
