  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Roy_Emerton">
    <ns1:abstract>Roy Emerton (9 October 1892 – 30 November 1944) was a British film actor. Earlier in his life, he was a sailor, stoker, docker, railway worker, and miner and served in the First World War. He played in a great number of popular London stage plays and shows, including Shakespeare, as well as film work.</ns1:abstract>
