    <ns1:abstract>Mere Khuda was a Pakistani television series which was aired on 2 February 2015 at Hum TV. It starts with Mehmood Akhtar, Nimra Khan, Agha Ali, Sumbul Iqbal, Saba Faisal, Sabahat Ali Bukhari, Javed Sheikh, Seemi Pasha, Kanwar Arsalan, Humayun Ashraf on their leading roles. It had 48 Episodes. It was ended on 20 May 2015. It is directed by Barkat Siddiqui and written by Muhammad Asif Ali.</ns1:abstract>
