    <ns1:abstract>Ryouta Murai (村井 良大, Murai Ryōta) is a Japanese actor best known for his roles as Kojirō in Fūma no Kojirō, Kazuya Suzuki in Kamen Rider Den-O &amp; Kiva: Climax Deka, Takuya Yano in and Yusuke Onodera in Kamen Rider Decade.</ns1:abstract>
