  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bjarne_Henning-Jensen">
    <ns1:abstract>Bjarne Henning-Jensen (6 October 1908 – 21 February 1995) was a Danish film director and screenwriter. He directed 21 films between 1941 and 1974. He was born in Copenhagen, Denmark and died in Denmark. He was married to Astrid Henning-Jensen.</ns1:abstract>
