    <rdfs:label>Carlos Velo</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:abstract>Carlos Velo (15 November 1909 – 10 March 1988) was a Spanish film director. He directed 45 films between 1934 and 1983. His 1956 film Torero! was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature.</ns1:abstract>
