  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Per_Myrberg">
    <rdfs:label>Per Myrberg</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:abstract>Per Nils Myrberg (born 11 July 1933) is a Swedish singer and actor. Born in Stockholm, Myrberg has appeared in 45 films since 1957 including The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo. He is father to Olle Myrberg and Fredrik Myrberg.</ns1:abstract>
