    <rdfs:label>Peter Keglevic</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:abstract>Peter Keglevic (born 1950) is an Austrian film director and screenwriter. He has directed 30 films since 1976. His film Bella Donna was screened at the 1983 Cannes Film Festival.</ns1:abstract>
