    <ns1:abstract>Masatō Ibu (伊武 雅刀, Ibu Masatō, real name: Satoru Murota (室田 悟, Murota Satoru)) is a Japanese actor and voice actor. He is sometimes credited as Masato Eve.</ns1:abstract>
