    <rdfs:label>Edward Bluemel</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:abstract>Edward Bluemel is an English actor best known for his portrayal of Marcus Whitmore in Sky One's adaptation of A Discovery of Witches (2018), based on the book of the same name by Deborah Harkness. Bluemel was also featured in The Halcyon (2017), The Commuter (2018), Sex Education (2019) and Killing Eve (2019).</ns1:abstract>
