  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Horace_B._Carpenter">
    <ns1:abstract>Horace B. Carpenter (January 31, 1875 – May 21, 1945) was an American actor, film director, and screenwriter. He appeared in more than 330 films between 1914 and 1946. He also directed 15 films between 1925 and 1934. Born in Grand Rapids, Michigan, Carpenter died in Hollywood, California, from a heart attack.</ns1:abstract>
